	// Metadata-at-rest backfill (encrypt url/alias_url/username/category/notes,
	// compute url_bidx/alias_url_bidx). Runs once at boot via
	// VaultHandler.BackfillMetadataAtRest; idempotent (enc:v1: prefix guards it).
